## Future Scope

The Smart Parking System can be further enhanced by integrating IoT, automation, and mobile technologies.

* 📱 **Mobile Application Integration** – Develop a mobile app to show available parking slots in real time.
* ☁️ **Cloud Integration** – Store parking data in a cloud platform for monitoring and analysis.
* 🌐 **IoT-Based Monitoring** – Connect the Arduino/ESP32 system to the internet for remote parking management.
* 📍 **GPS and Location Services** – Help users locate nearby parking facilities.
* 💳 **Automated Payment System** – Integrate digital payment methods for automated parking charges.
* 🎫 **Online Slot Reservation** – Allow users to reserve available parking slots through a web or mobile application.
* 🔢 **Automatic Vehicle Identification** – Add RFID, QR codes, or camera-based license plate recognition for vehicle identification.
* 📊 **Parking Analytics** – Analyze occupancy patterns, peak hours, and parking duration.
* 🚘 **Support for Multiple Slots** – Expand the system to monitor larger parking areas with multiple slots.
* 🤖 **AI-Based Smart Parking** – Use computer vision or AI to improve vehicle detection and optimize parking management.
* 🔔 **Notifications and Alerts** – Send notifications when slots become available or when unauthorized vehicles are detected.
* 🔋 **Energy-Efficient Operation** – Optimize the system for low-power and long-term deployment.
